        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a global leader in biosimulation science, technology, and consulting services for using Model-Informed Drug Development (“MIDD”) in the global biopharmaceutical and biotech industry.",
